cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CinematicEarth: cinematic Google Earth Studio flyovers with GeoTIFF products"
abstract: >-
  CinematicEarth turns a list of places and GeoTIFF products into cinematic Google Earth
  Studio flyovers: slow, tilted orbits at each stop, paced flights between stops, GeoTIFFs
  as 2D draped or 3D extruded KML layers, and annotated MP4 output.
authors:
  - family-names: Mayer
    given-names: Timothy
    affiliation: "NASA EarthRISE, University of Alabama in Huntsville"
version: 0.3.1
date-released: 2026-10-28
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23746921
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/MayerT1/CinematicEarth"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/CinematicEarth/"
keywords:
  - google earth studio
  - flyover
  - kml
  - geotiff
  - geospatial
  - remote sensing
